WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:02.700
Still sitting on inventory that won't move?

00:02.850 --> 00:07.800
Dodecahedron turns slow-moving stock into mystery products customers love.

00:08.550 --> 00:11.400
Pick your slow movers. Set a price,

00:11.400 --> 00:13.800
and choose how many items go in each box.

00:13.800 --> 00:16.000
Preview one, then launch.

00:17.100 --> 00:21.200
Old stock becomes revenue, and every order is a surprise.

00:21.600 --> 00:24.400
No Liquid edits. No theme updates.

00:24.400 --> 00:26.900
Your theme already knows how to sell it.

00:27.300 --> 00:30.000
Install, create, and go live.

00:30.900 --> 00:34.700
Dodecahedron. Turn dead stock into delight.
